  "id": "BIT-tomcat-2026-86350",
  "summary": "Apache Tomcat: Regression in fix for CVE-2026-41293 can trigger request header mix-up",
  "details": "Inconsistent interpretation of HTTP/2 requests ('HTTP Request/Response smuggling') vulnerability in Apache Tomcat caused by a regression in fix for CVE-2026-41293 can trigger request header mix-up.\n\n\n\nThis issue affects Apache Tomcat: from 11.0.22 through 11.0.25, from 10.1.55 through 10.1.59, from 9.0.118 through 9.0.121.\n\n\n\nUsers are recommended to upgrade to version 11.0.26, 10.1.60 or 9.0.122, which fix the issue.",
  "aliases": [
    "CVE-2026-86350"
  ],
